# design/ = the design project's code, verbatim. Their docs and data never
# enter git (their project has none of our sanitization rules): a pull copies
# the code files they list (their data/TO-DEBLOB.md) by hand, and these catch
# what slips. Their homes: docs in docs/, data in data/, CLAUDE.md and
# github.md at the root.
design/docs/
design/data/
design/support.js
design/*.md
design/*.json
design/*.png
